---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SchemaMarkup from '../components/SchemaMarkup.astro';
import TrustBar from '../components/TrustBar.astro';
import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import { PHONE_DISPLAY, PHONE_TEL } from '../consts';
import { faqPageSchema } from '../lib/schema';

const faqs = [
	{
		question: 'Do you serve all of AllianceTexas, or only the Fort Worth part?',
		answer:
			'We serve the whole AllianceTexas area, including the parts outside Fort Worth city limits. We also serve the rest of Fort Worth and North Texas.',
	},
	{
		question: 'Is a vending machine really free?',
		answer:
			'Yes, for qualifying locations. We cover the equipment, delivery, setup, stocking, and repairs. You provide the floor space and a power outlet.',
	},
	{
		question: 'Our building has a lot of truck drivers and visitors. Can vending handle that?',
		answer:
			'Yes. Cashless machines and smart coolers work well for drivers and visitors. We can place a unit near the driver area so they do not need to enter the warehouse.',
	},
	{
		question: 'Can you work around our dock schedule and badge rules?',
		answer:
			'Yes. We plan service visits around your shift changes and access rules. Our route drivers follow your check-in steps.',
	},
	{
		question: 'Our headcount jumps during peak season. Do we need new equipment?',
		answer:
			'Not always. We often restock more often first. If that is not enough, we can add a machine, a cooler, or a micro market for the busy months.',
	},
	{
		question: 'We already have machines from another company. Can you take over?',
		answer:
			'Yes. We can replace, repair, or move existing machines, no matter who supplied them.',
	},
];
---

<BaseLayout
	title="AllianceTexas Vending Services | Fort Worth"
	description="AllianceTexas vending services for warehouses, offices, and logistics sites in Fort Worth. Free placement, cashless machines, and local 24/7 service."
>
	<SchemaMarkup slot="head" schema={faqPageSchema(faqs)} />

	<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-ink text-white">
		<div
			class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(188,33,39,0.5),transparent_60%),radial-gradient(ellipse_at_bottom_left,rgba(24,35,74,0.9),transparent_60%)]"
			aria-hidden="true"
		>
		</div>
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 md:py-28">
			<p class="eyebrow !text-white/60">Fort Worth &amp; North Texas</p>
			<h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl leading-[1.05] uppercase md:text-6xl">
				AllianceTexas Vending Services for Fort Worth Businesses
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/80">
				Your night shift clocks in at 10 p.m. The nearest food is a drive away, and breaks are short.
				So your team eats whatever is left in the old machine, if it works at all. Maybe it is
				empty. Maybe it only takes cash. Maybe it has been broken for two weeks and nobody knows who
				to call.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/80">
				Texas Vending fixes that. We put free, fully stocked vending machines, smart coolers, and
				micro markets in AllianceTexas buildings. Then we keep them full and working, day and night.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
				<a href="/contact-us/" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Free Site Visit</a>
				<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-outline">
					Call {PHONE_DISPLAY}
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<TrustBar />

	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700 [&_h2]:mt-14 [&_h2]:mb-4 [&_h2]:text-4xl [&_h2]:uppercase [&_h2]:text-slate-900 [&_h3]:mt-6 [&_h3]:text-2xl [&_h3]:text-slate-900 [&_p]:mt-4 [&_a]:font-semibold [&_a]:text-brand [&_a:hover]:underline">
		<h2 class="!mt-0">What Are AllianceTexas Vending Services?</h2>
		<p>
			AllianceTexas is a 27,000-acre business and residential area in north Fort Worth. It reaches
			across nine cities in Tarrant and Denton counties. More than 600 companies and over 73,000
			workers are based there. Many of them work in large warehouses, at Perot Field Fort Worth
			Alliance Airport, or around the BNSF rail yard.
		</p>
		<p>
			Our AllianceTexas vending services give those workers good food and drinks without leaving the
			building. We supply and stock:
		</p>
		<ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
			<li><a href="/our-services/vending-machine/">Snack and drink vending machines</a></li>
			<li><a href="/our-services/micro-markets/">Micro markets</a> with fresh meals and self-checkout</li>
			<li><a href="/our-services/ai-smart-cooler/">AI smart coolers</a> for grab-and-go items</li>
			<li><a href="/our-services/coffee-water/">Office coffee and water service</a></li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			We also handle <a href="/our-services/vending-repair/">vending machine repair</a> and
			<a href="/our-services/vending-moving/">vending machine moving</a> across Fort Worth and North
			Texas.
		</p>

		<h2>Who It's For</h2>
		<p>
			If people work at your site and get hungry, we can help. Most of our Alliance clients fall into
			one of these groups:
		</p>
		<h3>Warehouses and distribution centers</h3>
		<p>
			Big buildings mean long walks to the break room. Short breaks mean no time to drive for food.
			We size the setup to your building so nobody wastes their break walking.
		</p>
		<h3>Airport, rail, and trucking sites</h3>
		<p>
			Drivers and carriers come and go all day. Cashless machines and smart coolers let them grab
			something fast, even if they never set foot in the main building.
		</p>
		<h3>Manufacturing plants</h3>
		<p>
			Three shifts need food at three different times. We keep machines full for the 2 a.m. crew, not
			just the day shift.
		</p>
		<h3>Offices, schools, and apartments</h3>
		<p>
			Alliance is more than warehouses. We also serve offices, school campuses, and apartment
			communities across the area.
		</p>

		<h2>How It Works</h2>
		<p>Getting started is simple. Most sites go from first call to a stocked machine in four steps.</p>
		<ol class="mt-4 list-decimal space-y-3 pl-6">
			<li><strong>Reach out.</strong> Call us or fill out our <a href="/contact-us/">contact form</a>. Tell us about your building and team size.</li>
			<li><strong>Site walk.</strong> We visit your location before we quote. We look at your space, your power, and your traffic.</li>
			<li><strong>Free install.</strong> We deliver and set up your equipment at no cost. You provide the floor space and a power outlet.</li>
			<li><strong>We run it.</strong> We stock, clean, and repair everything. You do not have to manage a thing.</li>
		</ol>

		<h2>What to Expect</h2>
		<p>Once your equipment is in place, here is what working with us looks like:</p>
		<ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
			<li><strong>Smart restocking.</strong> Our machines report sales in real time. We restock when items run low, not on a random calendar.</li>
			<li><strong>Visits that fit your schedule.</strong> We plan around your shift changes, dock schedule, and badge rules.</li>
			<li><strong>Cashless payment.</strong> Every machine takes cards, mobile wallets, and tap-to-pay.</li>
			<li><strong>Fast repairs.</strong> A broken cooler can spoil food, so we treat refrigeration problems as same-day fixes.</li>
			<li><strong>Healthy choices.</strong> Fresh meals, protein snacks, and better-for-you drinks, plus the classic favorites.</li>
			<li><strong>Room to grow.</strong> If your team grows or peak season hits, we add equipment or service more often.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Why Choose Texas Vending</h2>
		<p>
			Plenty of companies can drop off a machine. Fewer can keep it full at a building that never
			closes. Here is what sets us apart:
		</p>
		<ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
			<li><strong>We are local.</strong> Our team is based in Dallas and works North Texas every day.</li>
			<li><strong>We know Alliance.</strong> We understand long buildings, round-the-clock shifts, and strict site access.</li>
			<li><strong>No long-term contract.</strong> We earn your business by doing the job well.</li>
			<li><strong>One partner for everything.</strong> Vending, micro markets, coffee, repairs, and moves all come from one team.</li>
			<li><strong>We take over old machines.</strong> Already have equipment from someone else? We can repair it, move it, or replace it.</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			Want to see if your site qualifies for free vending? Call us at
			<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`}>{PHONE_DISPLAY}</a> or <a href="/contact-us/">send us a message</a>.
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="bg-slate-50">
		<FAQ faqs={faqs} />
	</div>

	<CTA
		heading="Get Free Vending at Your AllianceTexas Site"
		text="Book a free site visit. We will look at your space and recommend the right machines for your team. No cost and no long-term contract."
		buttonLabel="Book a Free Site Visit"
	/>
</BaseLayout>
